      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.36,
      "end_seconds": 306.65,
      "duration_seconds": 24.29,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like a minor head injury without worrying signs i'm going to put you on paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days it's for headache someone should stay with you tonight, and no alcohol or contact sport for now"
    },
